      <VERS vnumber="1"> To the chief <gr str="5329">Musician</gr>, A <gr str="4210">Psalm </gr>of <gr str="1732">David</gr>. <gr str="8085">Hear </gr>my <gr str="6963">voice</gr>, O <gr str="430">God</gr>, in my <gr str="7879">prayer</gr>: <gr str="5341">preserve </gr>my <gr str="2416">life </gr>from <gr str="4480 6343">fear </gr>of the <gr str="341">enemy</gr>. </VERS>
