      <VERS vnumber="6"> They search <gr str="2664">out </gr>
        <gr str="5766">iniquities</gr>; they <gr str="8552">accomplish </gr>a diligent <gr str="2665 2664">search</gr>: both the <gr str="7130">inward </gr>
